/winery-and-vineyard-economic-development-grant-program-wvedg\">Winery and Vineyard Economic Development Grant Program (WVEDG)</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n</aside>\n<div class=\"margin-y-8 desktop:margin-top-10 desktop:margin-bottom-15 grid-col-12 desktop:grid-col-8\" id=\"page-content\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"usa-prose maryland-toc-target\">\n<p>Grants provide funding you do not have to repay for specific activities like exporting, workforce training, manufacturing and industry growth. Most have set eligibility requirements and application windows.</p><ul><li><a class=\"maryland-link\" href=\"https://www.medco-corp.com/programs-and-grants/build-our-future\">Build Our Future Grant Program</a></li><li><a class=\"maryland-link\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\" data-entity-type=\"node\" data-entity-uuid=\"46f92a72-ca79-4745-b919-600ca84de895\" href=\"/financial-incentives/grants/meif\" title=\"Maryland E-Nnovation Initiative Fund (MEIF)\">E-Nnovation Initiative Fund (MEIF)</a></li><li><a class=\"maryland-link\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\" data-entity-type=\"node\" data-entity-uuid=\"924cf681-fa74-4283-b784-bad29d3b5dc8\" href=\"/financial-incentives/grants/exportmd-program\" title=\"ExportMD Program\">ExportMD Program</a></li><li><a class=\"maryland-link\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\" data-entity-type=\"node\" data-entity-uuid=\"742ca963-1e8a-41d5-b196-8235f89d1328\" href=\"/financial-incentives/grants/global-gateway\" title=\"Global Gateway\">Global Gateway</a></li><li><a class=\"maryland-link\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\" data-entity-type=\"node\" data-entity-uuid=\"813249f0-b529-4c30-89c7-24eabb1a762d\" href=\"/financial-incentives/grants/maryland-alcohol-manufacturing-fund\" title=\"Maryland Alcohol Manufacturing Fund\">Maryland Alcohol Manufacturing Fund</a></li><li><a class=\"maryland-link\" href=\"https://commerce.prod.maryland.gov/financial-incentives/grants/maryland-made\">Maryland MADE (Manufacturing Assets Deployed for Energy)</a></li><li><a class=\"maryland-link\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\" data-entity-type=\"node\" data-entity-uuid=\"4cb65778-57f2-4c8c-bf69-e896ffb4e51f\" href=\"/financial-incentives/grants/maryland-manufacturing-40-m40\" title=\"Maryland Manufacturing 4.0 (M4.0)\">Maryland Manufacturing 4.0 (M4.0)</a></li><li><a class=\"maryland-link\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\" data-entity-type=\"node\" data-entity-uuid=\"002b832c-529f-47be-9c27-7f85c7fc1fd3\" href=\"/financial-incentives/grants/partnership-workforce-quality-pwq\" title=\"Partnership for Workforce Quality (PWQ)\">Partnership for Workforce Quality (PWQ)</a></li><li><a class=\"maryland-link\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\" data-entity-type=\"node\" data-entity-uuid=\"2279ee40-7e85-4508-96bf-8813a3b4d6f8\" href=\"/financial-incentives/grants/winery-and-vineyard-economic-development-grant-program-wvedg\" title=\"Winery and Vineyard Economic Development Grant Program (WVEDG)\">Winery and Vineyard Economic Development Grant Program (WVEDG)</a></li></ul><p> </p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</main>"
